ant formats still regularly produced in Cuba. سُمِّيت تيمنًا بـ the ocean liner sunk in 1915. A cigar for solemn great occasions — it tolerates neither haste nor distraction.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Lusitanias\"]}, {\"name\": \"8-9-8 Collection\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Sold in boxes of 25 arranged 8-9-8. Panetela format (33 x 170mm), the finest ever produced in Cuba. Deceptive lightness: the narrow ring gauge concentrates aromas into unexpected intensity. Beloved by Parisian المتحمسون.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"8-9-8 Varnished\"]}, {\"name\": \"Habaneros\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The entry-level range — but at Partagás, \'entry\' is relative. The Habaneros Short are the everyday pleasure cigars of Havanans themselves. Short (42 x 110mm), intense, smoked in 20 دقيقة. The true popular Cuban flavor, without ceremony.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Short\", \"Club\"]}]', '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx smoked cigars constantly on stage and in life. He reportedly said: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx fumaba cigars constantly on stage and in life. Supuestamente dijo: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx rauchte cigars constantly on stage and in life. Er soll gesagt haben: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx smoked cigars constantly on stage and in life. 据报道他曾说： \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Somerset Maugham\", \"anecdote\": \"The British author described the Partagás Lusitanias as \'the only thing for which I would make the trip to Havana.\' He had boxes delivered to London via the embassy.\"}, {\"name\": \"Groucho Marx\", \"anecdote\": \"Marx smoked cigars constantly on stage and in life. يُروى أنه قال: \'A cigar at this point is no longer a vice. It is a philosophy.\'\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. A pairing for connoisseurs.\"}, {\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee notes of a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tea\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. Un maridaje para conocedores.\"}, {\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee notas de a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"Té\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. Eine Paarung für Kenner.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee Noten von a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tee\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. 行家的搭配.\"}, {\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee 风味： a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"茶\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Bas-Armagnac 20 years\", \"notes\": \"The depth of aged Armagnac resonates with the powerful earthy character of a Serie D. مقارنة للمتذوقين.\"}, {\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Irish Porter\", \"notes\": \"The roasted coffee نكهات: a porter amplify the cocoa in the Serie D. Surprising but devastating.\"}, {\"type\": \"الشاي\", \"name\": \"Aged Pu-erh 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The fermented, earthy, deep Pu-erh is the ultimate tea pairing with Partagás. Both share the same telluric complexity.\"}]'),
  ('Romeo y Julieta', 'cuba', '1875 — La Havane, Cuba', 'Fondée en 1875 par Inocencio Álvarez, Romeo y Julieta doit sa célébrité mondiale à un seul homme : Sir Winston Churchill. Le Premier ministre britannique découvrit la marque lors d\'un voyage à Cuba en 1895 — il avait 21 ans et n\'était encore que journaliste de guerre. Il en deviendra le plus grand ambassadeur involontaire de l\'histoire du tabac.\r\n\r\nChurchill fumait entre 8 et 10 cigares par jour, sept jours sur sept, jusqu\'à sa mort en 1965. Sa préférence absolue : le Double Corona — format qui porta ensuite son nom pour l\'éternité. On raconte que lors du Blitz de Londres, alors que les bombes tombaient sur la ville, Churchill ne quittait jamais son abri sans sa boîte de Romeo y Julieta. Les sous-marins allemands ciblaient, selon la légende, les navires transportant les cigares cubains destinés à Downing Street.\r\n\r\nLa marque perpétue depuis 1948 ce format Churchill (47 x 178mm) comme pièce maîtresse de sa collection — 45 minutes d\'une complexité florale et crémeuse qui explique tout.', '[\r\n  {\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#DC143C\",\"story\":\"Format Churchill (47 x 178mm) — nommé en hommage direct au Premier ministre. 45 minutes de fumée. Notes florales, crème, cèdre doux. Le cigare le plus accessible et le plus recommandé aux amateurs en progression. Churchill lui-même en commandait des boîtes personnalisées avec sa bague distinctive. Score Cigar Aficionado 93.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":93,\"year\":2021}]},\r\n  {\"name\":\"Exhibición No.4\",\"color\":\"#B22222\",\"story\":\"Lancée en 1875, format Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). L\'entrée en matière parfaite dans l\'univers Romeo y Julieta — douce, florale, légèrement crémeuse. Les experts recommandent de commencer par ce format avant de s\'aventurer vers le Churchill.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Exhibición No.4\",\"Exhibición No.3\"]},\r\n  {\"name\":\"Wide Churchill\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"Format épais (55 x 178mm), même longueur que le Churchill mais calibre 55 — l\'un des plus larges jamais produits à Cuba. La surface accrue du wrapper intensifie les notes crémeuses et vanillées. Fumée en 60 minutes. Réservé aux amateurs qui ne transigent pas sur l\'épaisseur.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"Wide Churchill\"]},\r\n  {\"name\":\"Éditions Régionales\",\"color\":\"#9B2335\",\"story\":\"Romeo y Julieta produit chaque année des éditions régionales exclusives pour différents marchés — Allemagne, Espagne, UK, Benelux. Les Cazadores EL (2018, Allemagne) et les Short Churchills EL sont particulièrement recherchés. Certains collectionneurs voyagent en Europe uniquement pour acquérir des éditions régionales locales.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Variable\",\"vitolas\":[\"Cazadores\",\"Short Churchill\",\"Coloniales\"]}\r\n]', '2026-03-18 09:43:40', '2026-08-14 15:26:40', '[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":93,\"year\":2021,\"vitola\":\"Churchill\"},{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":92,\"year\":2019,\"vitola\":\"Wide Churchill\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"Winston Churchill\",\"anecdote\":\"Churchill fuma son premier Romeo y Julieta à 21 ans à Cuba et ne s\'arrêta plus jamais. Il fumait 8 à 10 cigares par jour. Son médecin l\'avait mis en garde — Churchill répondit : \'Mon médecin m\'a dit d\'arrêter les diners. Nous nous sommes séparés.\'. Il mourut à 90 ans, cigare à la main.\"},{\"name\":\"Clark Gable\",\"anecdote\":\"L\'acteur hollywoodien faisait livrer ses Romeo y Julieta directement à MGM Studios. Sur le tournage d\'Autant en emporte le vent, il aurait fumé plus de 300 cigares.\"}]', '[{\"type\":\"Champagne\",\"name\":\"Bollinger R.D. 2007\",\"notes\":\"La bulle fine et la minéralité du Bollinger subliment les notes florales du Churchill. L\'accord le plus élégant qui soit.\"},{\"type\":\"Whisky\",\"name\":\"Springbank 12 ans\",\"notes\":\"La légère tourbe et le sel de Springbank contrebalancent parfaitement la douceur crémeuse d\'un Romeo y Julieta.\"},{\"type\":\"Thé\",\"name\":\"Darjeeling First Flush\",\"notes\":\"Le thé le plus floral du monde rencontre le cigare le plus floral de Cuba. Accord délicat réservé aux après-midi ensoleillés.\"}]', '[\"Romeo y Julieta Cazadores EL (2018, Allemagne)\",\"Romeo y Julieta Short Churchill EL\",\"Romeo y Julieta 125 Aniversario\",\"Romeo y Julieta Wide Churchill Edición Regional\"]', 'Briones Montoto, La Havane', 'Romeo y Julieta was founded in 1875 by Inocencio Álvarez, a Havana manufacturer who understood that a great name was the first condition of greatness. The brand\'s romantic title — drawn from Shakespeare, whose plays Cuban cigar workers knew well through their lector sessions — carried an emotional charge that translated across languages and cultures. Within two decades, Romeo y Julieta had won gold medals at exhibitions in Amsterdam, Paris, and Chicago. Álvarez commissioned the finest lithographers in Havana to produce bands and box labels of extraordinary visual quality. The brand looked like what it tasted like: exceptional.\r\n\r\nThe defining relationship in the brand\'s history began in 1895. Winston Churchill was 21 years old, working as a war correspondent covering the Cuban independence struggle, and he was introduced to Romeo y Julieta cigars during his three-week stay in Havana. The encounter was transformative. Churchill would go on to smoke between 8 and 10 cigars per day, every single day, for the next 70 years — through two world wars, the Blitz, countless parliamentary sessions, and the writing of a six-volume history of the Second World War that earned him the Nobel Prize in Literature. His absolute preference was the Double Corona: 47 x 178mm, approximately 45 minutes of floral, creamy, cedary complexity that companions describe as inseparable from the man himself.\r\n\r\nThe brand honored the relationship in 1948 by naming its Double Corona format the Churchill — a distinction no other brand had offered a living statesman. Churchill reportedly found the gesture amusing rather than presumptuous. The format remains the centerpiece of the collection, made at the Romeo y Julieta factory in Havana\'s Belascoaín district and distributed through Habanos S.A.\'s global network.\r\n\r\nRomeo y Julieta\'s profile stands in deliberate contrast to the power brands of the Cuban portfolio. Where Partagás and Bolívar push earthiness and intensity, Romeo trades in florality, cream, and an almost orchestral sense of progression. The cigars open with cedar and light spice, develop through hazelnut and white pepper, and finish on dried fruit and honey. It is the brand that most converts describe as their gateway to understanding what Cuban tobacco could be — and for many serious smokers, it is the brand they return to after exploring the extremes.\r\n\r\nThe Reserva line, using aged tobaccos from selected Vuelta Abajo plots, extends the house\'s ambition into collector territory. The Wide Churchill, launched in 2008, updated the classic format with a slightly wider ring gauge that delivers a cooler, longer smoke. The brand\'s limited editions — released annually through Habanos S.A.\'s Gran Reserva and Regional Edition programs — are among the most anticipated in the calendar.', 'Romeo y Julieta fue fundada en 1875 por Inocencio Álvarez. Debe su fama mundial a Sir Winston Churchill, quien la descubrió en Cuba a los 21 años y fumó entre 8 y 10 cigarros diarios hasta su muerte. El Churchill (47x178mm), formato bautizado en su honor, es 45 minutos de complejidad floral y cremosa.', 'Romeo y Julieta wurde 1875 von Inocencio Álvarez gegründet. Weltberühmt wurde die Marke durch Sir Winston Churchill, der sie mit 21 Jahren in Kuba entdeckte und bis zu seinem Tod täglich 8 bis 10 Zigarren rauchte. Das Churchill-Format (47x178mm) wurde ihm zu Ehren benannt.', '罗密欧与朱丽叶由伊诺西昂西奥·阿尔瓦雷斯于1875年创立。它的世界声誉归功于温斯顿·丘吉尔——他21岁在古巴发现了这个品牌，此后每天吸8至10支，直到去世。以他命名的丘吉尔规格（47×178mm）是45分钟的花香与奶油复杂性。', 'تأسست روميو وخولييتا عام 1875 على يد إينوسينسيو ألفاريز. اشتهرت عالميًا بفضل السير ونستون تشرشل الذي اكتشفها في كوبا وهو في الحادية والعشرين، وظل يدخن 8 إلى 10 سيجارات يوميًا حتى وفاته. مقاس تشرشل (47×178ملم) سُمِّي على شرفه.', '[{\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#DC143C\", \"story\": \"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft cedar notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing enthusiasts. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Cigar Aficionado score 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\": \"#B22222\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exhibición No.4\", \"Exhibición No.3\"]}, {\"name\": \"Wide Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and vanilla notes. Smoked in 60 minutes. Reserved for enthusiasts who do not compromise on ring gauge.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Wide Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Regional Editions\", \"color\": \"#9B2335\", \"story\": \"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some collectors travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"Cazadores\", \"Short Churchill\", \"Coloniales\"]}]', '[{\"name\":\"Churchill\",\"color\":\"#DC143C\",\"story\":\"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft cedro notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing aficionados. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 93.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Churchill\"],\"scores\":[{\"source\":\"Cigar Aficionado\",\"score\":93,\"year\":2021}]},{\"name\":\"Exhibición No.4\",\"color\":\"#B22222\",\"story\":\"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Claro\",\"vitolas\":[\"Exhibición No.4\",\"Exhibición No.3\"]},{\"name\":\"Wide Churchill\",\"color\":\"#8B0000\",\"story\":\"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and vainilla notes. Smoked in 60 minutos. Reserved for aficionados who do not compromise on ring gauge.\",\"force\":\"Medium-Full\",\"wrapper\":\"Habano Colorado\",\"vitolas\":[\"Wide Churchill\"]},{\"name\":\"Ediciones Regionales\",\"color\":\"#9B2335\",\"story\":\"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some coleccionistas travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\",\"force\":\"Medium\",\"wrapper\":\"Variable\",\"vitolas\":[\"Cazadores\",\"Short Churchill\",\"Coloniales\"]}]', '[{\"name\":