'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' Murió a los 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he supuestamente fumaba over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill rauchte his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He rauchte 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' Er starb im Alter von 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he angeblich rauchte over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill smoked his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He smoked 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' 他以 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he 据报道 smoked over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill smoked his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He smoked 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' توفي عن عمر 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he يُقال إن smoked over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Champagne\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral notes of the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tea\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Champán\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral notas de the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"Té\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Champagner\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral Noten von the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tee\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"香槟\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral 风味： the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"茶\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"الشامبانيا\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral نكهات: the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"الشاي\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]');
